ermine what kind of container is better: steel or aluminum!\n\nWill becoming involved in this ridiculously twisted research project gone amuck complicate Kakeru's life incredibly? Of course it will, but because Melon's steel body needs carbon dioxide to breathe, he's now stuck with her since she's too CO2 dependent! And when his wealthy, attractive, best childhood friend Najimi gets HER own aluminum Akikan, the trouble really begins!\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Card Battle","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Witch","rank":46,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Baseball","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boys' Love","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yuri","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Akikan!","english":"Akikan!","native":"アキカン!","romaji":"Akikan!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"空罐少女"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}